    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">CT Measurement</rdfs:label>
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Take measurements at least two times from full ground cover to the end of booting (pre-heading), and at least two times from the end of anthesis to late grainfilling (grain-filling) -with 5-7 days between each measurement to give a reasonably heritable estimate of trait expression.</ns1:definition>
