    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Modified cobb scale for severity</rdfs:label>
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Severity of leaf/stem/stripe rust is recorded as a percentage, according to the modified Cobb scale. As this relies upon observation it cannot be absolutely accurate. Thus it is common to use the following intervals: 0, 5, 10, 20, 40, 60, and 100 percent infection.</ns1:definition>
