  <ns2:Class rdf:about="https://cropontology.org/rdf/CO_321:0000376">
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Number of days from sowing to booting stage (DS45). However, when planting in dry soils in dryland areas it is counted from the first day of rainfall or irrigation which is sufficient for germination, or from emergence date.</ns1:definition>
