    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://cropontology.org/rdf/Measurement"/>
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Leaf area of flag leaf or all laminas is measured. Then the leaves are oven dried at 60-70oC for 48h and the dry weight is recorded. Then, the specific leaf area is calculated as the ratio of leaf area to dry mass SLA= leaf area/dry mass.</ns1:definition>
  </ns2:Class>
