    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://cropontology.org/rdf/Computation"/>
    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Calculated  with climatic data where degree days are accumulating between anthesis (DS65) and maturity (DS87) of crop cycle duration (thermal time from day1+day2+day3...). To calculate daily thermal time= (Temperature max + Temperature min)/2.</ns1:definition>
